sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant F as Frontend
    participant B as Backend API
    participant W as Wallet
    participant R as Sweep router (Base)
    participant D as DEXes
    participant FC as Fee collector

    U->>F: Press Sweep
    F->>F: Check deadline (30 min), price impact gate,<br/>suppress double-clicks
    F->>B: POST /build-tx
    B->>B: Re-check live balances · validate routes vs<br/>allowlist (config + on-chain) · build calldata
    B-->>F: Calldata + approvals + typed data (if permit2 mode)
    alt One-Click route
        F->>W: wallet_sendCalls: approvals + sweep, atomic
        W->>U: One confirmation
    else Sign & Sweep route
        F->>W: Exact approvals (first time only)
        F->>W: signTypedData (gas-free)
        W->>U: Setup / Sign prompts
        F->>B: Rebuild with signature
        B-->>F: Final calldata
        F->>W: eth_sendTransaction
        W->>U: Sweep confirmation
    end
    U-->>W: Confirm
    W->>R: Transaction submitted
    R->>R: Pull exact inputs (Permit2 or allowance)
    loop Each route, best-effort
        R->>D: Approve exact → swap → reset approval
        D-->>R: Output (or leg fails → skipped)
    end
    R->>U: Refund inputs of skipped legs
    R->>FC: Protocol fee (2%, cap 3%)
    R->>U: Net output (ETH unwrapped if chosen)
    R-->>W: Receipt
    F->>F: Verify receipt status == success
    F->>B: POST /record-sweep (points, quests)
    F->>U: Success summary + BaseScan link
    F->>F: Rescan balances
